# Java Design

## Structure

- Prefer composition over inheritance
- No unnecessary abstractions (no interfaces unless required)
- Keep methods under 20 lines
- Use Java 21 records for value objects — not Lombok

## Thread safety

- Calculators and services should be stateless where possible
- Mutable state lives in thread-safe in-memory repositories (`ConcurrentHashMap`)
- Return defensive copies from repositories (`List.copyOf`)

